[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 33003.31, "timestamp": "09:10:03", "text": "呃，如何讓時間倒流？如何讓時間倒流？我不想是10。那樣的話我就得結束了。  已經直播超過4個小時了，但是4個小時還是太短了。你是什​​麼意思"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 33008.068, "timestamp": "09:10:08", "text": "？但是，哦，是的。我忘了。我只能同時直播到六個人"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 33011.67, "timestamp": "09:10:11", "text": "。  呃，我真的很想去。不，健康最重要。開玩笑。是的。  [音樂] 是的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 33022.908, "timestamp": "09:10:22", "text": "，我比你強"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 33025.47, "timestamp": "09:10:25", "text": "。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 33033.908, "timestamp": "09:10:33", "text": "如何取消我的能力"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 33045.35, "timestamp": "09:10:45", "text": "拒不認罪。  什麼？我打算改變自己，將直播數量限制在三個。我當時速度很慢。  我一個流的上限是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 33054.068, "timestamp": "09:10:54", "text": "六個。一輛車。沒關係。嗯，大概是吧。"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 33055.408, "timestamp": "09:10:55", "author": "@Lecrux", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/Z2SYYu2dGH1dRyR2hhcKjasngKQM7XZC82KIjtDGvuXEPbUmH3XeYrU1hDkRjrirIElQWDh9=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "yoyo"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 33058.833, "timestamp": "09:10:58", "author": "@KonztellionHelper", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/GocLQxiJeUhcpFBwOECdYbCqbqHlCvz1B8j2gnfHQ1Q3AM1kFQ-eKqoi6TpMpyuxId3-6U94bcI=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "Shhh... Lecrux, Joq is resting. 🌙 Welcome to the Guild, and enjoy the past joq's memories!"}]